      ],
      "section_title": "7.10.6.3.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n使用Modbus TCP 快调时，需在后台与Logger5000 的ETH3 或ETH4 快调口之间架设\n一台交换机，并通过网线将两者进行连接。网线类型选择通用性标准网线即可，如\nCAT5E 类/长度75cm 网线。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        102.364,
        543.782,
        461.113,
        581.735
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-63AB5CA1F786DC31",
      "document_id": "DOC-D9C0DEB31D45",
      "source_sha256": "bd8dee22b45f3effc4323f330fd4db2eb92ab544cc41fc56835e0e5cd8eec71d",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 79,
      "printed_page_label": "69",
      "block_order": 28,
      "section_id": "SEC-22A6F784FCDB36EE",
      "section_path": [
        "7 Web界面",
        "7.10 系统",
        "7.10.6 转发配置",
        "7.10.6.3 转发MODBUS服务配置",
        "7.10.6.3.3 Modbus TCP快调模式"
      ],
      "section_title": "7.10.6.3.3 Modbus TCP快调模式",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n只需配置快调端口ETH3 或ETH4 其中一个网口的IP 地址即可，尽可能与后台IP 设置成\n同一网段。",
      "table_cells": null,
